      "side": 1,
      "message": "Having two BackendTypes (one in WGPURequestAdapterOptions and one in WGPURequestAdapterWebGPUBackendOptions) makes it unclear what they both do. I would probably suggest using only the WGPURequestAdapterOptions one and leaving this extension struct empty for now. (Just its presence implies that webgpu-on-webgpu should be used.)\n\nAn alternate design would be to use `WGPURequestAdapterOptions.backendType\u003d\u003dWebGPU` to request the WebGPU backend, which (optionally) can get extra options via an extension struct (including an inner-layer backendType request).",
